# Sin Hunting (windurst 72): Alexius's lines next to A Purchase of Arms' (the reply kinds). A level-40 RNG in Jugner
# Forest, Sin Hunting accepted by GM at Prog 2, A Purchase of Arms accepted by GM without the Weapons Order: its
# ALEXIUS_ORDERS (a name message, no state change) answers at Alexius on every talk. Prog 2: 10 (Progress) on both talks
# (option 1: nothing, Prog 2 kept). Prog 3 (GM): 11 (Progress) over ALEXIUS_ORDERS on both talks.
lists JugnerForest/Alexius/onTrigger
char zone=JugnerForest pos=101.9,5.4,386 job=RNG lvl=40
quest Windurst.SinHunting accepted
charvar Quest[2][72]Prog 2
quest Sandoria.APurchaseOfArms accepted
login
trigger Alexius                               # Prog 2: 10 (Progress) over ALEXIUS_ORDERS
finish option=1                               # nothing
trigger Alexius                               # 10 again
finish option=1
charvar Quest[2][72]Prog 3                    # GM
trigger Alexius                               # Prog 3: 11 (Progress) over ALEXIUS_ORDERS
finish-if-event
trigger Alexius                               # 11 again
finish-if-event
